            "text": "<p>For centuries, Indian homes have burned purified desi cow dung in yagnas and homams to cleanse the air. Aurora, from Stomatal Farms, turns that ritual into everyday sticks and cups: solar-dried cow dung blended with herbs, temple resins and natural extracts, hand-rolled with no charcoal and no bamboo core.</p><p><strong>It does not smell of dung.</strong> It burns slowly, smokes gently and fills your home with a clean, temple-like aroma. Every purchase also supports cow welfare and rescue.</p>",
